note <Attacks on the group termination judgment>

# Written by the item 1174 attack generator.
# Item term-self-host-001-1174 of note/project/term/self-host/change/001-finish-self-host. Since 8fe388e8 a task in a
# cycle with other tasks is judged on every call of the cycle (check/termination.tree `group-descends`: one fixed
# position, an order of positions, then size-change graphs). Each fixture below never ends, so each must read as not
# terminating (a warning naming the task) or, as a claim, be refused `looping-proof`. The controls are the shapes the
# judgment newly accepted (the generated size and forest pair, seam.tree page, list and cask from json): they must end.

load ../support/compiling
  find compile-text
  find compile-choice
  find refused-as
  find compiling-holds

load @term/base/list
  find contains

task choice
  like compile-choice

  back make(compile-choice, bind(file, <s.tree>))

# compiles, and no task is said not to end
task ending
  take text, like text
  like boolean

  host out, compile-text(text, choice())
  back and(out/ok, not(contains(out/warnings, <non-terminating>)))

# refused with the code `code`
task refused
  take text, like text
  take code, like text
  like boolean

  back refused-as(compile-text(text, choice()), code)

# compiles, and warns that the task `name` may not end
task looping-named
  take text, like text
  take name, like text
  like boolean

  host out, compile-text(text, choice())
  fork test, not(and(out/ok, contains(out/warnings, <non-terminating>)))
    hold
      back false
  walk out/warning-messages
    take message
    fork test, compiling-holds(message, <"{name}">)
      hold
        back true
  back false

test <two tasks swapping their arguments, nothing descending, do not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<form nat\n  case zero\n  case succ\n    link prior, like nat\n\ntask f\n  take a, like nat\n  take b, like nat\n  like number\n  send back\n    call g\n      read b\n      read a\n\ntask g\n  take a, like nat\n  take b, like nat\n  like number\n  send back\n    call f\n      read b\n      read a\n>, <f>)

test <a cycle whose swap composes to the identity, beside a descending call, does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<task f\n  take x, like number\n  take y, like number\n  like number\n  fork test\n    hook test\n      call is-maximum\n        read x\n        code 0\n    hook hold\n      send back\n        code 0\n  send back\n    call add\n      call g\n        read y\n        read x\n      call g\n        call subtract\n          read x\n          code 1\n        read y\n\ntask g\n  take x, like number\n  take y, like number\n  like number\n  send back\n    call f\n      read x\n      read y\n>, <f>)

test <a cycle falling on one edge and growing on the other does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<task f\n  take n, like number\n  like number\n  fork test\n    hook test\n      call is-maximum\n        read n\n        code 0\n    hook hold\n      send back\n        code 0\n  send back\n    call g\n      call subtract\n        read n\n        code 1\n\ntask g\n  take m, like number\n  like number\n  send back\n    call f\n      call add\n        read m\n        code 1\n>, <f>)

test <a cycle rebuilding the parameter itself, not a part of it, does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<form nat\n  case zero\n  case succ\n    link prior, like nat\n\ntask f\n  take n, like nat\n  like number\n  fork case, read n\n    case zero\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case succ\n      link p\n      send back\n        call g\n          read p\n\ntask g\n  take m, like nat\n  like number\n  send back\n    call f\n      make succ\n        bind prior\n          read m\n>, <f>)

test <a cycle descending on a different argument per edge while the other grows does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<form nat\n  case zero\n  case succ\n    link prior, like nat\n\ntask f\n  take a, like nat\n  take b, like nat\n  like number\n  fork case, read a\n    case zero\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case succ\n      link p\n      send back\n        call g\n          read p\n          make succ\n            bind prior\n              read b\n\ntask g\n  take a, like nat\n  take b, like nat\n  like number\n  fork case, read b\n    case zero\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case succ\n      link q\n      send back\n        call f\n          make succ\n            bind prior\n              read a\n          read q\n>, <f>)

test <a numeric cycle descending on a different argument per edge while the other grows does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<task f\n  take a, like number\n  take b, like number\n  like number\n  fork test\n    hook test\n      call is-maximum\n        read a\n        code 0\n    hook hold\n      send back\n        code 0\n  send back\n    call g\n      call subtract\n        read a\n        code 1\n      call add\n        read b\n        code 1\n\ntask g\n  take a, like number\n  take b, like number\n  like number\n  fork test\n    hook test\n      call is-maximum\n        read b\n        code 0\n    hook hold\n      send back\n        code 0\n  send back\n    call f\n      call add\n        read a\n        code 1\n      call subtract\n        read b\n        code 1\n>, <f>)

test <a cycle whose falling argument is reset from the other does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<task f\n  take n, like number\n  take m, like number\n  like number\n  fork test\n    hook test\n      call is-maximum\n        read n\n        code 0\n    hook hold\n      send back\n        code 0\n  send back\n    call g\n      call subtract\n        read n\n        code 1\n      read m\n\ntask g\n  take n, like number\n  take m, like number\n  like number\n  send back\n    call f\n      read m\n      read m\n>, <f>)

test <a cycle closed through a task read as a value does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<task f\n  take n, like number\n  like number\n  fork test\n    hook test\n      call is-maximum\n        read n\n        code 0\n    hook hold\n      send back\n        code 0\n  send back\n    call g\n      call subtract\n        read n\n        code 1\n\ntask g\n  take m, like number\n  like number\n  save h, read f\n  send back\n    call h\n      call add\n        read m\n        code 1\n>, <f>)

# the cycle runs through `omega` (its call of `k` may reach any task read as a value), so `omega` is the task named. `h`
# calls into the cycle and is in none, as any caller of a task that loops is judged on its own calls
test <self-application through a task parameter does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<task omega\n  take k, like dynamic\n  like number\n  send back\n    call k\n      read k\n\ntask h\n  like number\n  send back\n    call omega\n      read omega\n>, <omega>)

test <a claim of never by self-application through a task parameter is not proven>
  want hold, not(compile-text(<form never\n  case later\n    link next, like never\n\nrule omega\n  take k, like dynamic\n  like never\n\ntask omega\n  take k\n  send back\n    call k\n      read k\n\nrule absurd\n  like never\n\ntask absurd\n  send back\n    call omega\n      read omega\n>, choice())/ok)

test <a cycle whose named arguments are written out of order does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<form nat\n  case zero\n  case succ\n    link prior, like nat\n\ntask f\n  take a, like nat\n  take b, like nat\n  like number\n  fork case, read a\n    case zero\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case succ\n      link p\n      send back\n        call g\n          bind b, read p\n          bind a\n            make succ\n              bind prior\n                make succ\n                  bind prior\n                    read p\n\ntask g\n  take a, like nat\n  take b, like nat\n  like number\n  send back\n    call f\n      read a\n      read b\n>, <f>)

test <a self-call whose named arguments are written out of order does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<form nat\n  case zero\n  case succ\n    link prior, like nat\n\ntask f\n  take a, like nat\n  take b, like nat\n  like number\n  fork case, read a\n    case zero\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case succ\n      link p\n      send back\n        call f\n          bind b, read p\n          bind a\n            make succ\n              bind prior\n                make succ\n                  bind prior\n                    read p\n>, <f>)

test <a cycle through an arm field that hides a parameter of the same name does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<form box\n  case leaf\n  case wrap\n    link b, like box\n\ntask f\n  take a, like box\n  take b, like box\n  like number\n  fork case, read a\n    case leaf\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case wrap\n      link b\n      fork case, read b\n        case leaf\n          send back\n            code 0\n        case wrap\n          link c\n          send back\n            call g\n              make wrap\n                bind b\n                  make wrap\n                    bind b\n                      read a\n              read c\n\ntask g\n  take a, like box\n  take b, like box\n  like number\n  send back\n    call f\n      read a\n      read b\n>, <f>)

test <a self-call through an arm field that hides a parameter of the same name does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<form box\n  case leaf\n  case wrap\n    link b, like box\n\ntask f\n  take a, like box\n  take b, like box\n  like number\n  fork case, read a\n    case leaf\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case wrap\n      link b\n      fork case, read b\n        case leaf\n          send back\n            code 0\n        case wrap\n          link c\n          send back\n            call f\n              make wrap\n                bind b\n                  make wrap\n                    bind b\n                      read a\n              read c\n>, <f>)

test <a claim proven through an arm field hiding a parameter is looping-proof>
  want hold, refused(<form box\n  case leaf\n  case wrap\n    link b, like box\n\nrule f\n  take a, like box\n  take b, like box\n  like number\n\ntask f\n  take a\n  take b\n  fork case, read a\n    case leaf\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case wrap\n      link b\n      fork case, read b\n        case leaf\n          send back\n            code 0\n        case wrap\n          link c\n          send back\n            call f\n              make wrap\n                bind b\n                  make wrap\n                    bind b\n                      read a\n              read c\n>, <looping-proof>)

test <a cycle through a loop item that hides a parameter of the same name does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<form nat\n  case zero\n  case succ\n    link prior, like nat\n\ntask f\n  take n, like nat\n  take xs, like list, like nat\n  like number\n  save total, 0\n  walk list, read xs\n    hook next\n      take site, name n\n      save total\n        call add\n          read total\n          call g\n            read n\n            read xs\n  send back\n    read total\n\ntask g\n  take a, like nat\n  take xs, like list, like nat\n  like number\n  fork case, read a\n    case zero\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case succ\n      link p\n      send back\n        call f\n          read p\n          read xs\n>, <f>)

# `d` is a field of the local `b`, and the match on `x` binds a new `b`: the link from `d` to `b` must not then read
# `d` as a field of `x`. `f(a, d)` passes `a` unchanged and the same `d` forever
test <a self-call whose member link names a local rebound by a later arm does not end>
  want hold, looping-named(<form tree\n  case leaf\n  case node\n    link left, like tree\n    link right, like tree\n\ntask f\n  take a, like tree\n  take x, like tree\n  like number\n  fork case, read a\n    case leaf\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case node\n      link b\n      link s\n      fork case, read b\n        case leaf\n          send back\n            code 0\n        case node\n          link d\n          link e\n          fork case, read x\n            case leaf\n              send back\n                code 0\n            case node\n              link b\n              link t\n              send back\n                call f\n                  read a\n                  read d\n>, <f>)

test <control: an arm field hiding the very parameter matched, recursed on, ends>
  want hold, ending(<form box\n  case leaf\n  case wrap\n    link term, like box\n\ntask depth\n  take term, like box\n  like number\n  fork case, read term\n    case leaf\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case wrap\n      link term\n      send back\n        call add\n          code 1\n          call depth\n            read term\n>)

test <control: a task handed to a caller of its parameter, with no way back, ends>
  want hold, ending(<task apply\n  take f, like dynamic\n  take x, like number\n  like number\n  send back\n    call f\n      read x\n\ntask inc\n  take n, like number\n  like number\n  send back\n    call add\n      read n\n      code 1\n\ntask use\n  like number\n  send back\n    call apply\n      read inc\n      code 1\n>)

test <control: the generated size and forest pair, forest sizing a and b, ends>
  want hold, ending(<form tree\n  case leaf\n  case node\n    link left, like tree\n    link right, like tree\n\ntask size\n  take t, like tree\n  like number\n  fork case, read t\n    case leaf\n      send back\n        code 1\n    case node\n      send back\n        call forest\n          read left\n          read right\n\ntask forest\n  take a, like tree\n  take b, like tree\n  like number\n  send back\n    call add\n      call size\n        read a\n      call size\n        read b\n>)

test <control: the generated size and forest pair, forest sizing b twice, ends>
  want hold, ending(<form tree\n  case leaf\n  case node\n    link left, like tree\n    link right, like tree\n\ntask size\n  take t, like tree\n  like number\n  fork case, read t\n    case leaf\n      send back\n        code 1\n    case node\n      send back\n        call forest\n          read left\n          read right\n\ntask forest\n  take a, like tree\n  take b, like tree\n  like number\n  send back\n    call add\n      call size\n        read b\n      call size\n        read b\n>)

test <control: the seam.tree shape, three tasks descending once around through a list case, ends>
  want hold, ending(<form kind\n  case plain\n    link name, like text\n  case listed\n    link item, like kind\n\ntask page\n  take k, like kind\n  take depth, like number\n  like number\n  fork case, read k\n    case listed\n      link element\n      send back\n        call list-of\n          read element\n          read depth\n          code 0\n    case plain\n      send back\n        read depth\n\ntask list-of\n  take item, like kind\n  take depth, like number\n  take side, like number\n  like number\n  fork test\n    hook test\n      call is-equal\n        read side\n        code 1\n    hook hold\n      send back\n        call cask\n          read item\n          read depth\n  send back\n    call page\n      read item\n      read depth\n\ntask cask\n  take k, like kind\n  take depth, like number\n  like number\n  fork case, read k\n    case listed\n      link element\n      send back\n        call list-of\n          read element\n          read depth\n          code 1\n    case plain\n      send back\n        call page\n          read k\n          read depth\n>)

test <control: a cycle whose named arguments put the smaller value at the descending parameter ends>
  want hold, ending(<form nat\n  case zero\n  case succ\n    link prior, like nat\n\ntask f\n  take a, like nat\n  take b, like nat\n  like number\n  fork case, read a\n    case zero\n      send back\n        code 0\n    case succ\n      link p\n      send back\n        call g\n          bind b\n            make succ\n              bind prior\n                read b\n          bind a, read p\n\ntask g\n  take a, like nat\n  take b, like nat\n  like number\n  send back\n    call f\n      read a\n      read b\n>)
